WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.009
Today we will appreciate work using evidence. Our work connects with communities

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:05.811
across Africa.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:09.753
Describe visible lines, colours, textures and shapes.

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:13.710
Say which details help communicate the artist’s idea.

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:19.381
Give one evidence-based compliment and one possible improvement. Explain one

00:00:19.381 --> 00:00:23.193
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
